1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,643
Two named methods give chlorobenzene.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:07,981
The Sandmeyer reaction uses copper one chloride in hydrochloric acid.

3
00:00:07,981 --> 00:00:12,382
The Gattermann reaction uses copper powder with hydrochloric acid.

4
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:19,270
Iodobenzene needs no catalyst: just warm the diazonium salt with potassium iodide.

5
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:26,250
And fluorobenzene comes from the Balz Schiemann reaction, heating the dry fluoroborate salt.

